<title>USA: Toastmaster looks to restructuring analysis.</title>
<headline>Toastmaster looks to restructuring analysis.</headline>
<dateline>COLUMBIA, Mo. 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Toastmaster Inc, a manufacturer of electrical consumer appliances, said it expects an evaluation of a restructuring of its product lines to be presented to directors by year-end.</p>
<p>It said strategic initiatives that might be recommended could include disposition of certain products or segments of the company's business as well as acquisition of complementary products or businesses.</p>
<p>	   -- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
</text>
